name punknova
category Package
revision 24649
shortdesc OpenType version of Knuth's Punk font
longdesc The font was generated from a MetaPost version of the sources
longdesc of the 'original' punk font. Knuth's original fonts generated
longdesc different shapes at random. This isn't actually possible in an
longdesc OpenType font; rather, the font contains several variants of
longdesc each glyph, and uses the OpenType randomize function to select
longdesc a variant for each invocation.
